cff-version: 1.2.1
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: >-
  Open Dream-RSI: An Open-Source Library for Recursive Self-Improvement Around
  a Frozen LLM, with Replay-Gated Learned Policies and a Curated Knowledge Base
authors:
  - family-names: Orwat
    given-names: Patryk
    alias: patrykorwat
    email: patrykorwat@gmail.com
    website: https://github.com/patrykorwat
version: 0.3.10
date-released: "2026-10-22"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/patrykorwat/open-dream-rsi"
abstract: >-
  An open implementation of the Dream-RSI architecture: a frozen LLM agent
  improves through an offline "dreaming" loop — counterfactual replay over
  recorded Discovery Trees promotes exploration policies, verified recipes and
  curated lessons only when they beat the incumbent. Zero runtime dependencies
  (Python 3.10+ stdlib).
keywords:
  - llm agents
  - self-improvement
  - offline reinforcement learning
